title: Party Recruitment
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: recruitment_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; recruitment_timer = 3
card-image: img/Wheat_Pool_Ad.jpg

= Recruitment

The party membership is the heart and soul of the party. Declining membership is a sign of a weakened political force. 

- @heavy_recruitment: Initiate a largescale membership drive across the province
- @light_recruitment: Initiate a small recruitment campaign across the province. 
- @selective_recruitment: Begin a recruitment campaign in a specific region. 
- @easy_discard

@heavy_recruitment
subtitle: A singular, widespread recruitment operation is more efficient resource wise
choose-if: resources >= 4; 
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; resources -= 4; membership_change += 150;

@light_recruitment
choose-if: resources >= 2; 
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; resoureces -= 2; membership_change += 60;

@selective_recruitment
choose-if: resources >= 2; 

WIP!

